{
  "title": "Mom, I'm Sorry",
  "description": "*“Mom, I’m sorry. Please don’t die.”*\n\nWhen Henry realizes death is at his mother’s doorstep, he strikes a deal with a lifespan dealer to give years of his own life to his ailing mother. Now, his mother is a 20-year-old college student with a full life ahead of her, and Henry devotes his remaining days to helping her live life to the fullest. But things turn complicated when his friend falls in love with her!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: Age Regression, Beautiful Female Character, Comedy, Drama, Family Life, Hard-Working Protagonist, Male Protagonist, Multiple Couples, Primarily Adult Cast, Romance, School Life, Secret Identity, Shinigami/Grim Reaper, Slice of Life, South Korea, Supernatural, Urban Fantasy, 2010s, 21st century, Adapted to Anime, Adapted to Donghua, Age Transformation, Appearance Different from Actual Age, Attempted Murder, Child Abuse, Childcare, Cohabitation, College, Contracts, Deal with the Devil, Death of Leading Characters, Death of Loved One, Debts, Depression, Domestic Abuse, Domestic Violence, Family, Fantasy, Fiancée, Flashbacks, Full Color, Golf, Heterosexual, Illness, Kidnapping, Korean, Korean Folklore, Loan Shark, Longstrip, Male Lead, Manhwa, Misunderstandings, Modern Era, Moral Dilemma, Mother, Mother and Son, Near-Death Experience, Old to Young, Orphanage, Parenthood, Protective Mother, Rumors, School, Single Mother, Single Parent, Time Rewind, Unrequited Love, Web Comic",
